# Starting in a background tab (openplayground#5): SlideApp::logic took its second call to mean the interface fonts
# were ready, but while the tab is hidden eframe runs only logic, no UI pass, so egui has no fonts yet and noting the
# interface text panicked ("No fonts available until first call to Context::run()"), leaving a blank canvas. Ready
# only once a UI pass has run. Verify: open /deckcraft/ in a background tab, switch to it: the sample deck is drawn.
# Upstream head now sets fonts_ready in ui_setup (a real UI pass), so background-tab-fonts.head.diff is empty; delete
# this diff once the newest release has that too.
--- a/crates/ui-egui/src/lib.rs
+++ b/crates/ui-egui/src/lib.rs
@@ -1598,5 +1598,5 @@
             self.styled = true;
             self.restyle = true;
-        } else {
+        } else if ctx.cumulative_pass_nr() > 0 {
             self.fonts_ready = true;
         }
